# 🤯 OMG — Oh My GitHub.

### 🚀 One Prompt In. A Full Game or App Out. 🚀

[![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-🔥%20works-brightgreen?style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/denaidark/OhMyGithub/actions)
