Add methods.

`progressQuest` careful matching and avoid duplicate completion while iterating. We'll mark and call completeQuest after loop. If completeQuest triggers addXp -> checkAchievements -> maybe level -> refresh quests, no reentrancy issue maybe. Use `this.questProgressLock`? Simpler collect completed quests then after loop complete each if status active.

`refreshQuestAvailability(notify)` ensure all questState entries have progress arrays matching objective count; loaded old save maybe. If missing visible/status. Need not reset done.
